# Cursor Rules
# Enforces the SDD (Spec-Driven Development) workflow and AGENTS.md.

1. Read and update SPEC.md before changing any business logic; the requirement becomes a written contract first.
2. Fix a bug or add a feature by writing the focused test first, so the behavior can never silently regress.
3. Run the project's test suite after every change and keep it 100% green.
4. When the user corrects you, append the lesson to the lessons list at the bottom of AGENTS.md.
5. Rule index: standards/RULES.md. Every rule has exactly one home file - edit it there, link elsewhere.
6. The full code of conduct is in AGENTS.md; gates are in standards/TESTING.md.
